| 301 | `bash`     | Start Bash              | `bash`              |
| 302 | `sh`       | Start shell             | `sh`                |
| 303 | `echo`     | Print output            | `echo Hello`        |
| 304 | `printf`   | Formatted output        | `printf "%s" Hello` |
| 305 | `read`     | Read input              | `read name`         |
| 306 | `export`   | Set variable            | `export APP=prod`   |
| 307 | `env`      | Environment variables   | `env`               |
| 308 | `printenv` | Print environment       | `printenv PATH`     |
| 309 | `set`      | Shell variables/options | `set`               |
| 310 | `unset`    | Remove variable         | `unset APP`         |
| 311 | `alias`    | Create shortcut         | `alias ll='ls -la'` |
| 312 | `unalias`  | Remove alias            | `unalias ll`        |
| 313 | `source`   | Execute shell file      | `source ~/.bashrc`  |
| 314 | `exit`     | Exit shell              | `exit`              |
| 315 | `readlink` | Resolve links           | `readlink -f file`  |
| 316 | `expr`     | Basic expressions       | `expr 10 + 5`       |
| 317 | `let`      | Arithmetic              | `let x=10+5`        |
| 318 | `test`     | Test condition          | `test -f file`      |
| 319 | `true`     | Return success          | `true`              |
| 320 | `false`    | Return failure          | `false`             |

